      "reason": "The PhaseBessel references in candidate/statement-ledger.md:118-120,164-174,1339-1343,3161-3167 correctly describe its generality, helper status and exclusion of variance applications. Searching all packet library modules found PhaseBessel references only in its own module and the axiom-print declarations. The step-module Bessel-weight wording at :372-385 concerns Sobolev coordinate weights, not an asserted formalization or application of this lemma. The index defect is isolated in check LEDGER-INDEX."
