      "W1 — LEDGER-INDEX is incomplete and does not exactly reproduce the section's label assignments. candidate/statement-ledger.md:302-304 indexes only five distinct PhaseBessel declarations, whereas :2408-2419 contains twelve. Missing are memLp_conj, integrable_mul_of_memLp, integrable_smul_of_memLp, integrable_coeff_integrand, integrable_sum_norm_sq, residual_expand and isOrthonormalL2_conj. For example, Lean lean/StratonovichHAMSecondMoment/PhaseBessel.lean:104-106 states '(hu : ∀ k j, MemLp ... 2 μ) (hg : ∀ j, MemLp ... 2 μ) ... Integrable ...'; TeX manuscript/notes/integrated_wave_variance.tex:363 says 'The Bochner integrals exist by L² Cauchy–Schwarz'. The ledger correctly classifies the generalized helper as 'no direct label', but the index omits it and the six other auxiliaries. Also, :303 places phase_bessel under E:phase-bessel without identifying this as an additional cross-reference, unlike its L:phase-bessel row at :2416. Fix the index by adding the seven declarations under 'no direct label (auxiliary to the Lean proof route; PhaseBessel)' and removing or explicitly distinguishing the additional E:phase-bessel cross-reference. No mathematical Lean or coverage-row change is needed."
